@inherits LayoutComponentBase
@implements IDisposable
@inject NavigationManager Nav
@inject SiteContent C
@inject SupabaseClient Sb

<header class="site-header @(IsHome ? "" : "solid")">
    @if (Sb.IsLoggedIn)
    {
        <div class="admin-strip">
            <span>Inloggad som <strong>@Sb.Email</strong></span>
            <nav aria-label="Adminverktyg">
                <a href="admin?tab=event">Event</a>
                <a href="admin?tab=meny">Meny</a>
                <a href="admin?tab=texter">Texter</a>
                @if (EditTarget is { } target)
                {
                    <a class="as-edit" href="admin?tab=@target">✎ Redigera den här sidan</a>
                }
                <button type="button" @onclick="LogoutAsync">Logga ut</button>
            </nav>
        </div>
    }
    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(C["banner.text"]))
    {
        <div class="site-banner">@C["banner.text"]</div>
    }
    <div class="wrap nav">
        <a class="logo" href="" aria-label="Hallen Södermalm – startsida"><img src="img/logo.png" alt="Hallen"></a>
        <button class="burger" aria-label="Meny" aria-expanded="@menuOpen.ToString().ToLower()" @onclick="() => menuOpen = !menuOpen"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
        <ul class="nav-links @(menuOpen ? "open" : "")" @onclick="() => menuOpen = false">
            <li><NavLink href="" Match="NavLinkMatch.All">Start</NavLink></li>
            <li><NavLink href="meny">Meny</NavLink></li>
            <li><NavLink href="evenemang">Event</NavLink></li>
            <li><NavLink href="kontakt">Hitta hit</NavLink></li>
            <li><a class="btn btn-primary" href="boka-bord">Boka bord</a></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    @Body
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="foot-grid">
            <div>
                <img src="img/logo.png" alt="Hallen Södermalm">
                <p><Multiline Text="@C["footer.about"]" /></p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>Sidor</h4>
                <a href="">Start</a>
                <a href="meny">Meny</a>
                <a href="evenemang">Event &amp; sändningsschema</a>
                <a href="boka-bord">Boka bord</a>
                <a href="kontakt">Hitta hit</a>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>Öppettider</h4>
                <OpeningHours />
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4>Kontakt</h4>
                <p><Multiline Text="@C["contact.address"]" /></p>
                <a href="tel:@SiteContent.Digits(C["contact.phone"])">@C["contact.phone"]</a>
                <a href="mailto:@C["contact.email"]">@C["contact.email"]</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="copy">
            <span>© @DateTime.Now.Year Hallen Södermalm</span>
            <span>@C["footer.copy"]</span>
            <a class="staff-link" href="admin">Personal</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>

@code {
    private bool menuOpen;

    private bool IsHome
    {
        get
        {
            var path = Nav.ToBaseRelativePath(Nav.Uri).Split('?', '#')[0].Trim('/');
            return path.Length == 0;
        }
    }

    // Vilken admin-flik som hör till sidan man tittar på (null på admin-sidan själv).
    private string? EditTarget
    {
        get
        {
            var path = Nav.ToBaseRelativePath(Nav.Uri).Split('?', '#')[0].Trim('/').ToLowerInvariant();
            return path switch
            {
                "admin" => null,
                "meny" => "meny",
                "evenemang" => "event",
                _ => "texter"
            };
        }
    }

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        Nav.LocationChanged += OnLocationChanged;
        Sb.Changed += OnAuthChanged;
        await Sb.RestoreAsync();
    }

    private void OnLocationChanged(object? sender, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Routing.LocationChangedEventArgs e)
    {
        menuOpen = false;
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    private void OnAuthChanged() => _ = InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);

    private Task LogoutAsync() => Sb.SignOutAsync();

    public void Dispose()
    {
        Nav.LocationChanged -= OnLocationChanged;
        Sb.Changed -= OnAuthChanged;
    }
}
